note How the owner reviews an agent session's map changes without reading path output. The map at the parent revision comes from jj or git (Vcs in io-vcs, a shell-out, no VCS library) and is read by MapStore::base with the same reader as the files on disk; the working map is diffed against it by path name and step id (Map::diff in domain). The CLI prints it as diff; the GUI shows it as the Diff tab, as marks in the Paths list, and as tags on the steps of a document.

