note One path against its base. A step whose anchor (file, symbol, offsets or hash) differs is Repinned; one with only a different note is NoteEdited; one with only a different link is Relinked; an id missing from the base is Added. Base steps whose id this path lacks are kept as removed. A different path note, kind or group marks the header changed, and any of these makes the path Changed.

